// ---------------------------------------------
// The "Weekend Protocol"
// Automating the perfect Friday evening pint.
// ---------------------------------------------

// 1. Start the brew with high-energy ingredients
brew friday_ipa from water, 4 barley, 3 hops, 1 yeast.

toast "Work week ending... Brewing in progress.".

// 2. The wait is literal.
// Instead of calculating, we let the code mature.
age friday_ipa until is 5.5% abv.

// 3. Quality Control (Fuzzy Logic)
judge if friday_ipa is stronger than 6.0%:
    toast "Whoa, it's been a tough week!".
    // Smooth it out slightly
    filter friday_ipa by 1.1.
else:
    toast "Smooth sailing.".
    // Add a little kick
    fortify friday_ipa by 1.05.
end.

// 4. Lock the flavor so it doesn't spoil
keg friday_ipa.

toast "Your pint is ready. Cheers!".
taste friday_ipa.
